This project is a DeepSeek Harness / Cordis plugin adaptation of
free-vision-skill (https://github.com/niyongsheng/free-vision-skill).
The following files are derived from (or closely follow the logic of) that
upstream project, which is distributed under the MIT License:

- `scripts/ocr.swift` — macOS Vision OCR / image-description / layout logic;
- `src/swift.js` — image magic-number sniffing table (byte-identical to upstream);
- `src/upload.js` — upload security boundary (loopback-only, magic-number sniffing);
- `lib/client.js` — paste-image handling.

All other code (host/client glue, DSH subprocess integration, upload route,
configuration) is original work of this adaptation's author.

